title: The Chancellor's Order
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_law.svg

= The Chancellor's Order

[+ chancellor +] signs the order at midnight: the arrest of [+ pal_title +] for crimes against the Republic, as the Sith Lord Darth Sidious. [? if warrant : The Supreme Court's sealed warrant is attached. ?] [? if senate_jedi_pact or jedi_relation >= 60 : Master Windu and three Jedi Masters go with the Senate Guard. ?][? if not senate_jedi_pact and jedi_relation < 60 : The Jedi were not told in time; the Senate Guard goes alone. ?]

[? if cha_arrest_result = "fled" : The Guard finds his offices empty and his files burned. His shuttle left Coruscant an hour before the order was signed, under codes nobody can trace. Three days later he appears on Raxus at Count Dooku's side, no longer pretending to be anything but what he is. The Confederacy has a new master. ?][? if cha_arrest_result = "arrested" : He is at his desk when they come, as if he had been waiting. For a moment the red lightning fills the room. Then it is over, and **Darth Sidious** is led out of the Senate in binders, past senators who applauded him for years. He will stand trial before the Republic he meant to rule. ?][? if cha_arrest_result = "resisted" : He is not at his desk. He is in the Senate's lower levels with his Red Guard around him, and his orders are already going out to every man who still answers to him. [+ cha_arrest_missing +] Now there will be a fight for Coruscant. ?]

[? if cha_arrest_result = "arrested" and contingency : But as the binders close, a coded transmission goes out from somewhere in the Senate district to every clone commander in the galaxy. ?]

[? if cha_arrest_result != "fled" : The game now moves day by day. ?]
